<title>USA: U.S. rev Q1 corporate profits +3.5 pct (+4.5).</title>
<headline>U.S. rev Q1 corporate profits +3.5 pct (+4.5).</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerce Department estimates of first quarter profits by U.S. corporations, with comparisons. Profits before tax include inventory valuation and capital consumption adjustments.</p>
<p>Data are chain-weighted and expressed in seasonally adjusted annual rates of billions of dollars, with first quarter percent changes from the fourth quarter.</p>
<p> -		   Pct--Q1'97--Prev---Q4'96---1996</p>
<p> -  After Tax    3.5  422.3  426.5  408.2  406.8</p>
<p> -  Before Tax   6.3  712.5  716.8  670.1  670.2</p>
<p> Tax Liability   7.6  246.2  245.7  228.9  233.0</p>
